             <div class="celwidget aplus-module premium-module-3-four-column-images aplus-premium" cel_widget_id="aplus-premium-module-3-four-column-images" data-csa-c-id="k8m56o-i3pyc1-tsmxnz-l9t7bn" data-cel-widget="aplus-premium-module-3-four-column-images">
                    <div class="a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-3 aplus-container-1">                                   <div class="a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus-four-column"> <div class="a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus-column"> <div class="a-section a-spacing-none {&#39;column-image&#39;}">                                     <img alt="Touch controls" src="./sony-xm5_files/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/8e954cd8-8c75-4532-a876-6d4ca779a86d.__CR0,0,300,225_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg"><noscript><img alt="Touch controls" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/8e954cd8-8c75-4532-a876-6d4ca779a86d.__CR0,0,300,225_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg"/></noscript>  </div> <div class="a-section a-spacing-none column-heading">                                        <h1 class="aplus-h3 a-text-bold"> Touch controls </h1>    </div> <div class="a-section a-spacing-none column-description">                                   <p class="aplus-p3"> Pause/play/skip tracks, control volume, activate your voice assistant, and answer phone calls. </p>    </div> </div><div class="a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus-column"> <div class="a-section a-spacing-none {&#39;column-image&#39;}">                                     <img alt="Speak to Chat" src="./sony-xm5_files/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/e10d0e36-f97f-4408-8bb6-9bbf9b711e28.__CR0,0,300,225_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg"><noscript><img alt="Speak to Chat" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/e10d0e36-f97f-4408-8bb6-9bbf9b711e28.__CR0,0,300,225_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg"/></noscript>  </div> <div class="a-section a-spacing-none column-heading">                                        <h1 class="aplus-h3 a-text-bold"> Speak to Chat </h1>    </div> <div class="a-section a-spacing-none column-description">                                   <p class="aplus-p3"> As soon as you start a conversation, Speak-to-Chat automatically stops your music and lets in ambient sound. </p>    </div> </div><div class="a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus-column"> <div class="a-section a-spacing-none {&#39;column-image&#39;}">                                     <img alt="Adaptive Sound Control" src="./sony-xm5_files/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/6032bd74-4de5-4d0a-8c96-20b31c0a94e9.__CR0,0,300,225_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg"><noscript><img alt="Adaptive Sound Control" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/6032bd74-4de5-4d0a-8c96-20b31c0a94e9.__CR0,0,300,225_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg"/></noscript>  </div> <div class="a-section a-spacing-none column-heading">                                        <h1 class="aplus-h3 a-text-bold"> Adaptive Sound Control </h1>    </div> <div class="a-section a-spacing-none column-description">                                   <p class="aplus-p3"> Automatically optimizes volume based on your environment learning your behavior and recognizes locations that you frequently visit. </p>    </div> </div><div class="a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus-column"> <div class="a-section a-spacing-none {&#39;column-image&#39;}">                                     <img alt="Collapsible case saves space" src="./sony-xm5_files/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/29c683a8-aa18-42c3-8334-244a91ff9bc1.__CR0,0,300,225_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg"><noscript><img alt="Collapsible case saves space" src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/aplus-media-library-service-media/29c683a8-aa18-42c3-8334-244a91ff9bc1.__CR0,0,300,225_PT0_SX300_V1___.jpg"/></noscript>  </div> <div class="a-section a-spacing-none column-heading">                                        <h1 class="aplus-h3 a-text-bold"> Collapsible case saves space </h1>    </div> <div class="a-section a-spacing-none column-description">                                   <p class="aplus-p3"> Carry your headphones effortlessly in the redesigned case. </p>    </div> </div> </div> </div>     </div>
