- while some find them extremely comfortable and well-fitting around the ears, others report they start hurting the head and are too big for their head. The Bluetooth connectivity is also mixed, with some reporting great connectivity while others experience frequent disconnections. Value for money opinions are divided between those who find them absolutely worth the money and those who say they're not worth the price.<!-- k-injected k-component-close --></span><!-- k-injected k-component-close --><!-- k-injected k-component-close --><!-- k-injected k-component-close --><!-- k-injected k-component-close --></div><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-component=SharedContent-a1xC_XJJvXZe2O_ k-id=a4858991-81a3-4bb7-94d7-0cf5256d6c08 k-data=[omitted] k-closure-key=aspectReadMoreE_320_13 k-closure-holder=4522926e-7ae7-4d47-9d4b-626661a09175 k-init k-ready--><!-- k-injected k-decoded k-observe k-component=ExperimentalShow-m341qX1jtPsrE6B k-id=e1d3873c-7242-4b1b-83f8-1e5a1b39f0c5 k-composed=ExperimentalSho_165_5 k-parent=a4858991-81a3-4bb7-94d7-0cf5256d6c08 k-data=[omitted] k-init k-ready--><div class="aui-primitive __HcW37uIi- __HcWIi-82IiB1 __HcWIi-bS7X-z" style="" k-observe="" k-use="e1d3873c-7242-4b1b-83f8-1e5a1b39f0c5" k-class="condition_style_50_3" k-style="inlineStyles_51_3" k-init="" k-bound=""><div data-testid="ai-disclaimer" style="" class="aui-primitive __HcW37uIi- __HcWIi-82IY0d __P0nNOOvptwIJ __HcWz_SzO0"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" class="aui-primitive __HcWWkUdHN __HcWNg-FAv __3LVrZoFAv">AI Generated from the text of customer reviews</span><img src="./sony-xm5_files/sfwfCa9XX12F4At.png" k-metric-loaded-enabled="false" aria-hidden="true" style="display:inline-block;height:18px;width:18px;object-fit:cover;" class="aui-primitive __P0nNOOKHIa4a __P0nNOONh5Qzh __HcWIi-bS7X-z"><span style="white-space: pre-line;" aria-hidden="true" class="aui-primitive __dChNmAwPaMXsw4B __HcWIi-bS7a4a __SAR2l0zNyyuZ"> Generated from the text of customer reviews</span></div