a aria-label="Report Review" class="a-size-base a-link-normal a-color-secondary a-text-normal" href="javascript:void(0)" role="button">Report</a></div><span data-hook="reportAbuseSendingMessage" class="_Y3Itd_hidden_ySuSy">Sending feedback...</span><div data-hook="reportAbuseSuccessMessage" class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-success _Y3Itd_hidden_ySuSy a-spacing-block" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><div class="a-box-inner a-alert-container"><i class="a-icon a-icon-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="a-alert-content">Thanks, we'll investigate in the next few days.</div></div></div><div data-hook="reportAbuseErrorMessage" class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-error _Y3Itd_hidden_ySuSy a-spacing-block" role="alert"><div class="a-box-inner a-alert-container"><i class="a-icon a-icon-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="a-alert-content">Sorry, We failed to report this review. Please try again</div></div></div><div id="reportAbuseConfirmationDialog_R1QX35O9YTHQP2" data-closebuttonaria="Close Button" data-dialogheader="Report this review?" class="a-section aok-hidden"><div class="_Y3Itd_reportAbuseConfirmationContainer_1UPzg"><div class="a-section a-padding-large"><div class="a-row"><p>We'll check if this review meets our <a class="a-link-normal" target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=GLHXEX85MENUE4XF&amp;ref=cm_cr_cg">community guidelines<span class="aok-offscreen">Opens in a new tab</span></a>. If it doesn't, we'll remove it.</p></div><div class="a-row a-spacing-top-base"><div class="_Y3Itd_reportAbuseConfirmationActions_27dEm"><div data-mix-operations="ReportAbuseCancelClickHandler" data-id="R1QX35O9YTHQP2"><span class="a-button a-button-base" id="a-autoid-120"><span class="a-button-inner"><input type="submit" data-hook="reportAbuseCancelButton" class="a-button-input" aria-labelledby="a-autoid-120-announce"><span class="a-button-text" aria-hidden="true" id="a-autoid-120-announce">Cancel</span></span></span></div><div data-mix-operations="ReportAbuseConfirmClickHandler" data-id="R1QX35O9YTHQP2"><span class="a-button a-button-primary" id="a-autoid-121"><span class="a-button-inner"><input type="submit" data-hook="reportAbuseConfirmButton" class="a-button-input" aria-labelledby="a-autoid-121-announce"><span class="a-button-text" aria-hidden="true" id="a-autoid-121-announce">Report</span></span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="cr-review-media-popover-R1QX35O9YTHQP2" class="aok-hidden"><div class="a-section _Y3Itd_media-popover-container_2Vf8U"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-list-container_38-H0"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-container-overlay_1nuZ1" data-hook="ReviewMediaPopover" id="review-media-popover-content-R1QX35O9YTHQP2"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-content-wrapper_3MziH"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-background-wrapper_2UMSb"><div class="_Y3Itd_page-indicator-container_1X84N"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-page-indicator_10KaA" data-hook="PageIndicator"></div></div><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-topbar_knKqX"><button data-popover-id="R1QX35O9YTHQP2" class="_Y3Itd_close-button_2RG2d" data-hook="ReviewMediaPopoverCloseButton" data-mix-operations="ReviewMediaPopoverCloseButtonClickHandler" data-csa-c-type="element" data-csa-c-id="iv8lek-j6mtuj-7u2f2n-x5qhxd"><i class="a-icon a-icon-close-white a-icon-medium" role="presentation"></i></button></div><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-media-list-view-container_1kFg1" data-hook="ReviewMediaList"><button data-popover-id="R1QX35O9YTHQP2" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-media-list-overlay_2x3M5" data-mix-operations="ReviewMediaPopoverNextMediaClickHandler"></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></span></li><li><span class="a-list-item"><div data-hook="reviewContainer" data-translatable="false" data-reviewid="R296H0MM1B5KU8" data-asin="B0BXYCS74H" data-mobile="false" data-locale="en-US" data-localelanguagename="English" data-sourcelanguage="en-US" data-sourcelanguagename="English" data-iscustomerrecognized="true" data-iskindleapp="false" data-isandroidapp="false" data-isiosapp="false" data-ismshop="false" data-marketplaceid="ATVPDKIKX0DER"><div id="R296H0MM1B5KU8" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R296H0MM1B5KU8" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-hook="review" class="a-section aok-relative" data-csa-c-id="nhm27w-nay6c2-jpuobf-j92gho"><div data-hook="genome-widget" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AFONE4NRTXFNON6LMO2CQ643TRNA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R296H0MM1B5KU8_profile" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-profile _Y3Itd_profile-link_2n23E" data-a-size="small" data-csa-c-id="7x2vv6-85v8pb-lpnrxg-mpxp2a"><div aria-hidden="true" class="a-profile-avatar-wrapper"><div class="a-profile-avatar"><img src="./sony-xm5_files/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"><noscript><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"/></noscript></div></div><div class="a-profile-content"><span class="a-profile-name">Nick</span></div></a></div><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-star-rating-bar-desktop_1T97A"><i data-hook="review-star-rating" class="a-icon a-icon-star a-star-5"><span class="a-icon-alt">5 out of 5 stars</span></i><span class="a-letter-space"></span></div><a class="a-size-base a-color-base a-link-normal a-text-bold" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R296H0MM1B5KU8/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&amp;ie=UTF8"><h5 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="en-US">Well, they are good.</h5></a><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">Reviewed in the United States on July 11, 2026</span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a data-hook="format-strip" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/B0BXYCS74H/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_fmt?_encoding=UTF8&amp;formatType=current_format"><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Color: Midnight Blue</span></a><i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i><span class="_Y3Itd_inline-contributor_33jDb"><div data-hook="review-badges"><a class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_avp?ie=UTF8&amp;nodeId=G8UYX7LALQC8V9KA"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></a></div></span></div><div data-hook="reviewTextContainer" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM"><div data-hook="reviewText" class="a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-17"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-17-teaser-describedby-collapsed">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-17-teaser-describedby-expanded">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="true" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="peekExpand" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-17-card0" data-csa-c-id="632rjw-b7egun-lxp2lj-mi2qf8"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container a-reactive-container-transition"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized" data-a-max-height="300" style="max-height:300px"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-US" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>Greetings,</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>Good headphones for the price. I used to use Samsung Buds 1 as wireless earphones. For me this was a major update from Samsung earphones, I guess.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>+ Bluetooth works well. Sometimes in crowded spaces, like an office, earbuds used to disconnect randomly due to radio band congestion. These are working well, haven't experienced any disconnects for a month since I bought them.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>+ The battery life is much much longer comparing to my buds. I can charge them once in 2 weeks and use them for ~5 hrs 5 days a week.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>+ Weight is also good. I used to have some older Sony wireless headphones, don't remember the exact model, but it was from 2020. That sony was heavy, these are light. Not as light as my Dekoni Blue, but pretty good, considering the battery life and wireless feature. Also, surprisingly for closed headphones, it's not that hot in Texas summer, I comfortably wear them outdoors, a bit sweaty, but ain't a sweat river.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>+ Touch pad is cool, I also like that if you suddenly need to take them off for a moment, they will pause the media. Nobody will hear that you are listening to Merzbow.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>+ It seems that people are not very eager to by a blue colored headphones, but I like it. It looks beautiful to me. Blue like blueberries. I like blueberries. A little bit darker than blueberries, but hey, you know what? My left eye gives me less brightness than my right eye. I don't remember which eye did I use to evaluate the color though... It's blue!</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>+ Range is good as well, for sure it's enough for an apartment or 1 storey cave.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>+ Noise cancellation is good. it's not perfect, I can still hear a bit of chit-chatting on the background but it's definitely less distracting than the buds. Sharp sound like mech keyboard I can still hear though muffled.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>+ The super duper major upgrade for me is a mic. Damn, I don't know how to describe how bad Samsung Buds 1 mic was. People on a call hear everything around me birds, cars, THE WIND, oh that damn wind... but not my voice. Sony did a good job. Of course it's not perfect, but it works and it makes me happy.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>+ Well, now, the least important thing, sound quality, right?  It's good. I ain't Ludwig van Beethoven, but to me, they sound good. Ambient, DnB, folk, metal, darkthrone, everything sounds good.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>TLDR 9/10 because only Richard Stallman deserves 10/10.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click" data-csa-c-id="cym87m-91nm9c-s59x29-i6nzn2"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon a-css-icon-draw a-css-icon-expand"></i></span><span class="a-see-more a-color-link"><span class="a-see-more-text" style="">Read more</span><span class="a-see-less-text" style="display:none">Read less</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="translationSpinner" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner-container_ypxf2" style="display: none !important;"><div class="a-spinner-wrapper _Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner_1tBUJ"><span class="a-spinner a-spinner-medium"></span></div></div></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-top-small _Y3Itd_helpful-votes-container_3iphI"><span data-hook="helpful-vote-statement" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">23 people found this helpful</span></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-small a-spacing-top-small"><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-vote-action-bar_10AyR"><div data-hook="helpfulVoteWidget" class="a-section a-s