t:void(0)" role="button">Report</a></div><span data-hook="reportAbuseSendingMessage" class="_Y3Itd_hidden_ySuSy">Sending feedback...</span><div data-hook="reportAbuseSuccessMessage" class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-success _Y3Itd_hidden_ySuSy a-spacing-block" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"><div class="a-box-inner a-alert-container"><i class="a-icon a-icon-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="a-alert-content">Thanks, we'll investigate in the next few days.</div></div></div><div data-hook="reportAbuseErrorMessage" class="a-box a-alert-inline a-alert-inline-error _Y3Itd_hidden_ySuSy a-spacing-block" role="alert"><div class="a-box-inner a-alert-container"><i class="a-icon a-icon-alert" aria-hidden="true"></i><div class="a-alert-content">Sorry, We failed to report this review. Please try again</div></div></div><div id="reportAbuseConfirmationDialog_R22Z4O8BIRVG6P" data-closebuttonaria="Close Button" data-dialogheader="Report this review?" class="a-section aok-hidden"><div class="_Y3Itd_reportAbuseConfirmationContainer_1UPzg"><div class="a-section a-padding-large"><div class="a-row"><p>We'll check if this review meets our <a class="a-link-normal" target="_blank" rel="noopener" href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=GLHXEX85MENUE4XF&amp;ref=cm_cr_cg">community guidelines<span class="aok-offscreen">Opens in a new tab</span></a>. If it doesn't, we'll remove it.</p></div><div class="a-row a-spacing-top-base"><div class="_Y3Itd_reportAbuseConfirmationActions_27dEm"><div data-mix-operations="ReportAbuseCancelClickHandler" data-id="R22Z4O8BIRVG6P"><span class="a-button a-button-base" id="a-autoid-132"><span class="a-button-inner"><input type="submit" data-hook="reportAbuseCancelButton" class="a-button-input" aria-labelledby="a-autoid-132-announce"><span class="a-button-text" aria-hidden="true" id="a-autoid-132-announce">Cancel</span></span></span></div><div data-mix-operations="ReportAbuseConfirmClickHandler" data-id="R22Z4O8BIRVG6P"><span class="a-button a-button-primary" id="a-autoid-133"><span class="a-button-inner"><input type="submit" data-hook="reportAbuseConfirmButton" class="a-button-input" aria-labelledby="a-autoid-133-announce"><span class="a-button-text" aria-hidden="true" id="a-autoid-133-announce">Report</span></span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="cr-review-media-popover-R22Z4O8BIRVG6P" class="aok-hidden"><div class="a-section _Y3Itd_media-popover-container_2Vf8U"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-list-container_38-H0"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-container-overlay_1nuZ1" data-hook="ReviewMediaPopover" id="review-media-popover-content-R22Z4O8BIRVG6P"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-content-wrapper_3MziH"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-background-wrapper_2UMSb"><div class="_Y3Itd_page-indicator-container_1X84N"><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-page-indicator_10KaA" data-hook="PageIndicator"></div></div><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-topbar_knKqX"><button data-popover-id="R22Z4O8BIRVG6P" class="_Y3Itd_close-button_2RG2d" data-hook="ReviewMediaPopoverCloseButton" data-mix-operations="ReviewMediaPopoverCloseButtonClickHandler" data-csa-c-type="element" data-csa-c-id="wa8my0-2a6p0r-qnlr3q-iky7qu"><i class="a-icon a-icon-close-white a-icon-medium" role="presentation"></i></button></div><div class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-media-list-view-container_1kFg1" data-hook="ReviewMediaList"><button data-popover-id="R22Z4O8BIRVG6P" class="_Y3Itd_media-popover-media-list-overlay_2x3M5" data-mix-operations="ReviewMediaPopoverNextMediaClickHandler"></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></span></li><li><span class="a-list-item"><div data-hook="reviewContainer" data-translatable="false" data-reviewid="RHQKN00HDBMX4" data-asin="B09XS7JWHH" data-mobile="false" data-locale="en-US" data-localelanguagename="English" data-sourcelanguage="en-US" data-sourcelanguagename="English" data-iscustomerrecognized="true" data-iskindleapp="false" data-isandroidapp="false" data-isiosapp="false" data-ismshop="false" data-marketplaceid="ATVPDKIKX0DER"><div id="RHQKN00HDBMX4" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-RHQKN00HDBMX4" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-hook="review" class="a-section aok-relative" data-csa-c-id="rol95s-hq85af-3aeg73-kf6ars"><div data-hook="genome-widget" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AFJOZSFUJ5UASUW2UQDITE57GIRA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-RHQKN00HDBMX4_profile" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-profile _Y3Itd_profile-link_2n23E" data-a-size="small" data-csa-c-id="tjzlfw-di1cpn-hyndcc-ib7m4t"><div aria-hidden="true" class="a-profile-avatar-wrapper"><div class="a-profile-avatar"><img src="./sony-xm5_files/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"><noscript><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png"/></noscript></div></div><div class="a-profile-content"><span class="a-profile-name">D. Beyers</span></div></a></div><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-star-rating-bar-desktop_1T97A"><i data-hook="review-star-rating" class="a-icon a-icon-star a-star-5"><span class="a-icon-alt">5 out of 5 stars</span></i><span class="a-letter-space"></span></div><a class="a-size-base a-color-base a-link-normal a-text-bold" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/RHQKN00HDBMX4/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&amp;ie=UTF8"><h5 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="en-US">Excellent Headphones, Disappointing Amazon.com Experience</h5></a><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">Reviewed in the United States on August 8, 2026</span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a data-hook="format-strip" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/B09XS7JWHH/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_fmt?_encoding=UTF8&amp;formatType=current_format"><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Color: Black</span></a><i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i><span class="_Y3Itd_inline-contributor_33jDb"><div data-hook="review-badges"><a class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_avp?ie=UTF8&amp;nodeId=G8UYX7LALQC8V9KA"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></a></div></span></div><div data-hook="reviewTextContainer" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM"><div data-hook="reviewText" class="a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-21"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-21-teaser-describedby-collapsed">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-21-teaser-describedby-expanded">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="true" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="basic" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-21-card0" data-csa-c-id="roi892-10hpcn-y4af1j-gum10d"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container a-reactive-container-transition" style="height: auto;"><div><div class="a-cardui-content" data-a-max-height="300" style="max-height: none;"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-US" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>The Sony WH-1000XM5 are honestly a great pair of headphones. The sound quality is excellent, the noise cancelling is probably one of the best features, and they’re really comfortable even when wearing them for a few hours. The battery life is also very good, making them perfect for travelling or everyday use. The only downside for me is that they don’t fold as compactly as the older XM4s and the build could feel a little more solid. Overall, though, they’re a fantastic all-round pair of headphones and definitely worth considering, especially if you can get them at a good price.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>Unfortunately, my experience with Amazon.com was a completely different story. I originally ordered the headset through Amazon.com, but it was delivered to the wrong address. When I contacted Amazon about the issue, I was told that I needed to go to the police and file a report before they would consider refunding me, which was extremely disappointing.</span></p><p><span>In the end, I purchased the headset from Best Buy instead and had a much better experience. It also made me appreciate how much better my experiences have been with Amazon.co.za compared to Amazon.com. The product itself is excellent, but unfortunately the experience with Amazon.com left a very sour tast</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha a-hidden"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click" data-csa-c-id="q2jpu7-9uofk0-ke2pan-fwvq6j"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon a-css-icon-draw a-css-icon-expand"></i></span><span class="a-see-more a-color-link"><span class="a-see-more-text" style="">Read more</span><span class="a-see-less-text" style="display:none">Read less</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="translationSpinner" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner-container_ypxf2" style="display: none !important;"><div class="a-spinner-wrapper _Y3Itd_