-list-overlay_2x3M5" data-mix-operations="ReviewMediaPopoverNextMediaClickHandler"></button></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></span></li><li><span class="a-list-item"><div data-hook="reviewContainer" data-translatable="false" data-reviewid="R3CYACSSCXH52P" data-asin="B09XS7JWHH" data-mobile="false" data-locale="en-US" data-localelanguagename="English" data-sourcelanguage="en-US" data-sourcelanguagename="English" data-iscustomerrecognized="true" data-iskindleapp="false" data-isandroidapp="false" data-isiosapp="false" data-ismshop="false" data-marketplaceid="ATVPDKIKX0DER"><div id="R3CYACSSCXH52P" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R3CYACSSCXH52P" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-hook="review" class="a-section aok-relative" data-csa-c-id="61fahd-uw5ltl-mm9dkl-1poprz"><div data-hook="genome-widget" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHGJ5XYQEM4EHCAX7EBDT2XVQK3A?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R3CYACSSCXH52P_profile" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-profile _Y3Itd_profile-link_2n23E" data-a-size="small" data-csa-c-id="cv36r9-5qd9cb-lqhgmp-un6wmn"><div aria-hidden="true" class="a-profile-avatar-wrapper"><div class="a-profile-avatar"><img src="./sony-xm5_files/grey-pixel.gif" class="a-lazy-loaded" data-src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/ce195c39-e111-4104-be1a-5a0164a86708._CR109%2C0%2C281%2C281_SX460_SX48_.jpg"><noscript><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/ce195c39-e111-4104-be1a-5a0164a86708._CR109%2C0%2C281%2C281_SX460_SX48_.jpg"/></noscript></div></div><div class="a-profile-content"><span class="a-profile-name">Jerry Binder</span></div></a></div><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-star-rating-bar-desktop_1T97A"><i data-hook="review-star-rating" class="a-icon a-icon-star a-star-5"><span class="a-icon-alt">5 out of 5 stars</span></i><span class="a-letter-space"></span></div><a class="a-size-base a-color-base a-link-normal a-text-bold" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/srp/-/R3CYACSSCXH52P/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_ttl?_encoding=UTF8&amp;ie=UTF8"><h5 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="en-US">Worth every penny so far. Great sound, stunning ANC.</h5></a><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">Reviewed in the United States on June 30, 2026</span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a data-hook="format-strip" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/B09XS7JWHH/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_fmt?_encoding=UTF8&amp;formatType=current_format"><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Color: Black</span></a><i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i><span class="_Y3Itd_inline-contributor_33jDb"><div data-hook="review-badges"><a class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_avp?ie=UTF8&amp;nodeId=G8UYX7LALQC8V9KA"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></a></div></span></div><div data-hook="reviewTextContainer" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM"><div data-hook="reviewText" class="a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-22"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-22-teaser-describedby-collapsed">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-22-teaser-describedby-expanded">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="true" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="peekExpand" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-22-card0" data-csa-c-id="383h6o-ifxt0s-beor8d-v19iyk"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container a-reactive-container-transition" style="height: 300px;"><div><div class="a-cardui-content" data-a-max-height="300" style="max-height: none;"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-US" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>I did some pretty exhaustive research to figure out what over-ear headphones I should get during Prime Day. I picked these up for about $200, and so far I feel like that was a steal. The sound is as good as my Sennheiser HD 599 SE (which is the only other premium pair of over-ears I've had) but without all the background noise of their open backs. The features are great. A quick button press or a cupped hand over my right ear, and I can hear what's going on around me. If I get up and start walking around, I can have it automatically switch to ambient audio. With the Sony headphones app, I can switch between clear, balanced audio and warm bassy sound as I please.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>I've only ever had ANC on earbuds before, and though some of those have been really great, this is a whole 'nother level. There are times when I think I must be blowing my eardrums out with the volume because I truly can't hear anything else — not my fan, not my PC, not the AC, not even my husband talking in the next room. But then I take a look at my phone and realize the volume is only a couple of notches up. It's just *that* good at blocking all of those things out. I can't wait to see how well this quality of ANC fares on something like an airplane.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>I wear thick plastic framed glasses, and though I can certainly feel them pressing against my head with these on I can still wear both all day without any real discomfort. I go seamlessly from PC to phone without having to repair or anything. And as long as I plug them in at night, the battery level is never any concern.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click" data-csa-c-id="fq0c2c-omjuwx-3fty2e-57c01z"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon a-css-icon-draw a-css-icon-expand"></i></span><span class="a-see-more a-color-link"><span class="a-see-more-text" style="">Read more</span><span class="a-see-less-text" style="display:none">Read less</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="translationSpinner" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner-container_ypxf2" style="display: none !important;"><div class="a-spinner-wrapper _Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner_1tBUJ"><span class="a-spinner a-spinner-medium"></span></div></div></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-top-small _Y3Itd_helpful-votes-container_3iphI"><span data-hook="helpful-vote-statement" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">4 people found this helpful</span></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-small a-spacing-top-small"><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-vote-action-bar_10AyR"><div data-hook="helpfulVoteWidget" class="a-section a-spacing-none _Y3Itd_cr-voting-section_1cNTp"><div class="_Y3Itd_cr-helpful-button_1u3UK cr-vote-component" data-hook="helpfulVoteButton" data-mix-operations="HelpfulVoteClickHandler" data-asin="B09XS7JWHH" data-id="R3CYACSSCXH52P" data-return-to="DpReview" data-csa-c-type="element" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R3CYACSSCXH52P_helpful_button" data-csa-c-id="w44c0t-j6en1f-8blr72-fr4ovb"><span class="a-button a-button-base" id="a-autoid-137"><span class="a-button-inner"><input type="submit" class="a-button-input" aria-labelledby="a-autoid-137-announce"><span class="a-button-text