-space"></span></div><h5 class="_Y3Itd_single-review-title_2aKRE" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="pt-BR">Confortável e bom cancelamento de ruído</h5><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-base a-color-tertiary">Reviewed in Brazil on June 4, 2026</span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><a data-hook="format-strip" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/portal/customer-reviews/B09XSDMT4F/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_fmt?_encoding=UTF8&amp;formatType=current_format"><span class="a-size-base a-color-secondary">Color: Silver</span></a><i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i><span class="_Y3Itd_inline-contributor_33jDb"><div data-hook="review-badges"><a class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html/ref=cm_cr_dp_d_rvw_avp?ie=UTF8&amp;nodeId=G8UYX7LALQC8V9KA"><span data-hook="avp-badge" class="a-size-mini a-color-state a-text-bold">Verified Purchase</span></a></div></span></div><div data-hook="reviewTextContainer" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM"><div data-hook="reviewText" class="a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-28"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-28-teaser-describedby-collapsed">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-28-teaser-describedby-expanded">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="true" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="basic" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-28-card0" data-csa-c-id="7w57ni-13d9mu-asrbun-p48unr"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container a-reactive-container-transition" style="height: auto;"><div><div class="a-cardui-content" data-a-max-height="300" style="max-height: none;"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="pt-BR" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>O fone é ótimo. Ele é confortável e leve, tem função de pausar quando retirado e pode ser pareado com vários aplicados e dá pra escolher qual iniciar através do tipo de toque no fone. O porém é quem tem a cabeça menor, ele fica mais bambo, não tendo opção de deixar mais justo.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha a-hidden"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click" data-csa-c-id="9bheu2-tgr4rp-l9igoz-nh0885"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon a-css-icon-draw a-css-icon-expand"></i></span><span class="a-see-more a-color-link"><span class="a-see-more-text" style="">Read more</span><span class="a-see-less-text" style="display:none">Read less</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="translationSpinner" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner-container_ypxf2" style="display: none !important;"><div class="a-spinner-wrapper _Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner_1tBUJ"><span class="a-spinner a-spinner-medium"></span></div></div></div><div class="a-section a-spacing-small a-spacing-top-small"><div class="_Y3Itd_single-review-vote-action-bar_10AyR"><div data-hook="reportAbuseButton" data-mix-operations="ReportAbuseOpenDialogClickHandler" data-dialog-kind="modal" data-asin="B09XSDMT4F" data-id="R1IV1OO6V31YVT" data-return-to="DpReview" data-csa-c-type="element" data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review_foreign-R1IV1OO6V31YVT_report_button" data-csa-c-id="2a9308-jc2e3k-1lszb6-de7u8o"><a ar