    <div id="pqv-hidden-ingress" class="a-section a-padding-base desktop-ingress"> <h1 id="pqv-ingress" class="a-size-base a-text-normal">  <span class="a-declarative" data-action="toggle-pqv" data-toggle-pqv="{}"> <a id="pqv-trigger" class="a-link-normal" href="https://www.amazon.com/Sony-WH-1000XM5-Headphones-Hands-Free-WH1000XM5/dp/B09XS7JWHH?__mk_es_US=%C3%85M%C3%85%C5%BD%C3%95%C3%91&amp;crid=3VMHLEKDN7F3X&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.AiQTnHr7j97_VMmMJ1xxyGyKe07EpHd2QvBVXU5Z1GJDhoHWkkasjHH0PKXmKsAHT6BXGFr5uTmcS_lJWXrpn2M54bSm2uMiHZTdW8XK22qzWKnQ8UrHCXA5rsxu5XPFrupF822STzKzndLWJMm-R6BeUSB9ZFeqpNQwCF9pIHdShyyVZx0_Sy27MTxu2ebUSFUOsm5I7ZRe1xnnd5EaM7PXNcX3SMJV6dFliWiHPwI.v1ttUaYWP0_C9kxf_UHhZTAW27iks0k1-wep0IjdpY0&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=Sony%2BWH-1000XM5&amp;qid=1788929534&amp;sprefix=sony%2Bwh-1000xm5%2Caps%2C308&amp;sr=8-1&amp;th=1#" role="button"> <div class="a-section a-spacing-none popover-trigger-title aok-inline-block"> Product summary presents key product information <i aria-hidden="true" class="a-icon a-icon-popover" role="presentation"></i> </div> </a> </span> <hr aria-hidden="true" class="a-spacing-top-mini a-divider-normal"> <div id="pqv-shortcut-desc" class="a-section a-spacing-small"> <span class="shortcut-label a-text-bold">Keyboard shortcut&nbsp;</span> <span class="pqv-shortcut">
